<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LPMD - <%= desa.nama %></title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css?v=20261116">
</head>
<body class="bg-light">

    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="nav-brand">
            <img src="/uploads/Logo_desa.png" alt="Logo Desa" class="brand-icon" />
            <div class="brand-text"><span><%= desa.nama %></span></div>
        </div>
        <button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Buka menu navigasi" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-links">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </button>
        <ul class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
            <li><a href="/">Beranda</a></li>
            <li><a href="/pemerintahan/desa">Pemerintahan</a></li>
            <li><a href="/profil">Profil Desa</a></li>
            <li><a href="/layanan/pengaduan">Pengaduan</a></li>
            <% if (user) { %>
                <li><a href="/<%= user.role %>" class="btn-primary">Dashboard</a></li>
                <li><a href="/logout" style="color: #ef4444; font-weight: bold;">Logout</a></li>
            <% } else { %>
                <li><a href="/login" class="btn-primary">Login</a></li>
            <% } %>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <main class="lpmd-page">
        <section class="lpmd-hero">
            <div class="lpmd-hero-copy">
                <p class="lpmd-eyebrow">Lembaga Pemberdayaan Masyarakat Desa</p>
                <h1><%= desa.pemerintahan.lpmd.judul %></h1>
                <p class="lpmd-lead"><%= desa.pemerintahan.lpmd.deskripsi %></p>
                <div class="lpmd-actions">
                    <a class="lpmd-button lpmd-button-primary" href="#agenda">Lihat agenda <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
                    <a class="lpmd-button lpmd-button-quiet" href="/layanan/pengaduan">Sampaikan aspirasi <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lpmd-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="lpmd-art-orbit lpmd-art-orbit-outer"></div>
                <div class="lpmd-art-orbit lpmd-art-orbit-inner"></div>
                <div class="lpmd-art-center">
                    <span class="lpmd-art-mark">L</span>
                    <span>LPMD</span>
                </div>
                <span class="lpmd-art-dot lpmd-art-dot-one"></span>
                <span class="lpmd-art-dot lpmd-art-dot-two"></span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="lpmd-content" aria-label="Informasi LPMD">
            <article class="lpmd-info-card lpmd-card-focus">
                <span class="lpmd-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3v3m0 12v3M3 12h3m12 0h3M5.64 5.64l2.12 2.12m8.48 8.48 2.12 2.12m0-12.72-2.12 2.12m-8.48 8.48-2.12 2.12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg>
                </span>
                <p class="lpmd-card-label">Arah kerja</p>
                <h2>Fokus Pemberdayaan</h2>
                <p>LPMD bekerja bersama warga untuk memperkuat ekonomi lokal, membangun kolaborasi kelompok, dan mendorong kegiatan produktif yang memberi dampak nyata.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="lpmd-info-card lpmd-card-impact">
                <span class="lpmd-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 19V9m5 10V5m6 14v-7m5 7V8M2 19h20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </span>
                <p class="lpmd-card-label">Dampak untuk warga</p>
                <h2>Manfaat yang Terasa</h2>
                <p>Program pelatihan usaha, pendampingan kelompok tani, dan kegiatan unggulan membantu warga mengembangkan potensi serta meningkatkan kesejahteraan di <%= desa.nama %>.</p>
            </article>

            <section class="lpmd-agenda" id="agenda">
                <div class="lpmd-agenda-heading">
                    <div>
                        <p class="lpmd-card-label">Rencana aksi</p>
                        <h2>Agenda Utama</h2>
                    </div>
                    <span class="lpmd-agenda-count"><%= desa.pemerintahan.lpmd.tugas.length %> program</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="lpmd-agenda-list">
                    <% desa.pemerintahan.lpmd.tugas.forEach((item, index) => { %>
                        <li>
                            <span class="lpmd-agenda-number"><%= String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span>
                            <span><%= item %></span>
                            <span class="lpmd-agenda-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                        </li>
                    <% }) %>
                </ul>
            </section>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="footer-info">
                <h3><%= desa.nama %></h3>
                <p>Kepala Desa: <%= desa.kepalaDesa %> | Populasi: <%= desa.populasi %> Jiwa</p>
            </div>
            <p class="footer-copyright">&copy; 2026 Portal Resmi <%= desa.nama %></p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="/navigation.js?v=20261116"></script>
</body>
</html>
